# Employee Login & Comprehensive Profile Management

Enable every employee to login with their actual company email (e.g., `rajesh.kumar@company.com`), and build a rich, tabbed employee profile page in the Admin portal to manage personal, professional, education, salary revision, documents, address details, and password changes.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Employee-User Linking**: Currently `User` and `Employee` are separate, unlinked tables. This plan links them via a `userId` field on `Employee`. Every employee will get a `User` account created automatically (with EMPLOYEE role and default password `employee123`). Admins can still login via their existing accounts.

> [!WARNING]
> **Database Reset Required**: Schema changes (new models + new fields) will require `prisma db push --force-reset` + re-seed. Existing data in `dev.db` will be wiped and re-created from the updated seed.

